// Clue Name :
"P958444323" "{PERSON_NAME}'s story"
// DetailString :
"P3736272976" "When you rescued {PERSON_NAME}, she said:<br><br>'I've seen a lot of horrible things since I started this investigation. This Banished Pantheon cult, they're inhuman! They worship some kind of lost god-like beings, horrible prehistoric entities that feed on pain. Their chief god is Lughebu, who demands that they learn about all beings of power. Here, take this idol I discovered. I have a feeling there's some sort of dark magic about it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2859908882" "In the wake of the Rikti War, there's been a resurgence of all kinds of mysticism. This has helped in some cases, even providing the city with new hope. But it has also caused a great deal of trouble. One new cult calls itself the Banished Pantheon. They have some sort of dark power; they can animate the dead and call spirits from beyond the grave! A reporter named {PERSON_NAME} was investigating them, but now she's gone missing. <A HREF={ACCEPT}> Please find {PERSON_NAME} as soon as possible.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3655199291" "Find {PERSON_NAME}"
// SendOffString :
"P811877842" "The creatures we have seen the most frequently have been dubbed Husks; they seem to made from the animated bodies of the dead."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1102836220" "I am really counting on you to return {PERSON_NAME} to us safely."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2786430698" "Somewhere below, a woman's terrified screams echo in the darkness."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
