// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3501958056" "Lughebu says to send the woman's soul to them. They shall consume her and all that she knows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3841761763" "More intruders! More food for our masters!"

