"P2276824618" "According to {PERSON_NAME}, the Banished Pantheon is investigating all beings of power. I must say, that phrase has an ominous ring to it. Depending on the definition, it could include heroes like yourself."
// RandomFameString :
"P1615632587" "{HeroName}'s been fighting the Pantheon cultists. They better watch their step!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_BanishedPantheon_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1007402421" "A large number of pre-cognitives have been reporting visions of a nightmarish battle beneath the streets of the city. In these visions, the Banished Pantheon cultists battle the Circle of Thorns for control of some sort of mystic vortices that trap wandering spirits. And in these visions, you appear as well. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Are you willing to face this vision and stop both of these groups of mystic madmen?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2123241743" "Stop both groups of mystic madmen"
// SendOffString :
"P3357402508" "I don't know the purpose of that vortex, but I have been told that you must close it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P315776540" "Defeat all villains in sewer"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3183294142" "That mystic energy spike is still going off in the sewers."
// TaskTitle :
"P1602978438" "Stop the Mystic Madmen"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1460515284" "There is no wind down here, but something stirs the air around you. Every sense is on alert as you step into the edge of a spiritual tornado."

