// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P963293764" "There was a break-in at the Paragon City Museum. The thieves stole two items on loan to the museum from Mexico, stone idols to the Aztec gods Coatilcue and Tlaloc. One of the guards identified the thieves as members of the Banished Pantheon cult. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you recover the idols from the Banished Pantheon?</A> <color orange>They probably have the idols under magical guard; you'll need a teammate to help break their spells of protection.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P2244350185" "Recover the idols from the Banished Pantheon"
// SendOffString :
"P912521854" "I don't know the reason for the Banished Pantheon's interest in the old Aztec gods, but it can't bode well."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2481656160" "Defeat lead cultist, his coven"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2039102214" "Those Aztec idols are still sacred to some. I really need you to get them back in one piece."

