// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_BanishedPantheon_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1162065267" "The Banished Pantheon have been spreading their dark forces over the city. People are afraid, and I understand why. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero to hit the streets and defeat a few Pantheon cultists.</a> They've been seen often on Talos Island, and I've heard that Dark Astoria is completely overrun."
// AcceptString :
"P322052873" "Hit the streets and defeat a few Pantheon cultists"
// SendOffString :
"P2397640340" "Thanks for taking this on, {HeroName}. Be careful. The Pantheon is a powerful adversary."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3566721529" "Combat Banished Pantheon menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3642361349" "Those Pantheon cultists are still roaming the streets. I need you to take care of that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2063170183" "You have decreased the number of Banished Pantheon cultists roaming the streets."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3931417757" "The Pantheon cultists have grown fearsomely strong, {HeroName}. It's good that we have brave people like you who can fight them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_BanishedPantheon_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2908698142" "Though no one lives in Dark Astoria any more, there are still reports coming in from the few brave souls who are willing to venture into that haunted place. One of the more disturbing reports is that much of the zone is now overrun with walking dead controlled by the Banished Pantheon. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If the city is ever to retake Dark Astoria, we'll need heroes like you to clear the Banished Pantheon out.</a> Raimi Arcade and Toffet Terrace are completely overrun, though I think you can find cultists in any section of the zone."
// AcceptString :
"P2594551088" "Clear the Banished Pantheon out of Dark Astoria"
// SendOffString :
"P1518211420" "Be cautious, {HeroName}. Dark Astoria is a dangerous place. I'd recommend taking allies with you when you venture there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2388676919" "Combat Pantheon in Dark Astoria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3963437484" "You haven't made a big impression on the Pantheon, it seems. They are still running rampant in Dark Astoria."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1672646604" "You have decreased the number of Banished Pantheon cultists in Dark Astoria."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1992259237" "It may take years to get the Pantheon out of Dark Astoria, but with heroes like you on the case, it'll happen someday."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_BanishedPantheon_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1367436167" "Ever since Astoria became a hazard zone, few have dared to venture in there. Those that return report wandering hordes of Husks and Chambers animated by the dark powers of the Banished Pantheon. As long as they control the zone, it will be impossible for the city to retake that part of the city. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to take the fight to the Banished Pantheon in Dark Astoria.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1624262957" "Take the fight to the Banished Pantheon in Dark Astoria"
// SendOffString :
"P3408491730" "You could start in Romero Heights or Dido's View. Those neighborhoods are especially overrun."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2396954637" "I want you to put a dent in the Pantheon's activities. Back to Dark Astoria you go."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P259466706" "You have lessened the Banished Pantheon's hold on Dark Astoria."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3589491735" "Through your efforts and those of other heroes like you, Dark Astoria may one day be restored to the city. Thank you, {HeroName}."
